=========================================
PROBLEM: SIMPLE FOOD DELIVERY SYSTEM
=========================================

1. INTERFACE: Discountable
--------------------------
* Method: double applyDiscount(double percentage)


2. ABSTRACT CLASS: FoodItem
---------------------------
* Private Fields: String name, double price
* Constructor: Sets name and price
* Getters: getName(), getPrice()
* Abstract Method: void prepare()


3. CONCRETE CLASS: Pizza (Extends FoodItem, Implements Discountable)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
* Constructor: Passes name and price to super()
* Method prepare(): Print "Baking pizza in the oven..."
* Method applyDiscount(percentage): Reduce price by percentage, return new price


4. CONCRETE CLASS: Salad (Extends FoodItem)
----------------------------------------
* Constructor: Passes name and price to super()
* Method prepare(): Print "Chopping fresh vegetables..."


5. MAIN CLASS (Main)
--------------------
* Create Pizza ("Margherita", 10.0)
* Create Salad ("Caesar Salad", 6.0)
* Call prepare() on both
* Apply 20% discount on the pizza and print the new price
=========================================
